{
  "_comment": [
    "Arch pkgbase -> name of the same source in another ecosystem, where it differs.",
    "Keys under each pkgbase are OSV ecosystem families (Debian, Alpine, PyPI, Linux).",
    "{major} and {minor} expand from Arch's current version (python 3.14.8 -> python3.14).",
    "Names are added to the automatic candidates (same name, lib32- stripped, versioned",
    "names such as postgresql-18 / php8.5, python-foo -> py3-foo / PyPI foo); an empty",
    "list for a family disables that family for the pkgbase (known name collision).",
    "Only add a mapping when both names build the same upstream project."
